Package: spatialid
Title: Create Persistent Identifiers for Longitudinal Spatial Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
      "Emre",
      "Cebeci",
      email = "cebeciemre1@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description:
    Provides tools for creating persistent identifiers for spatial
    units observed across time. The package supports configurable
    rules for identifying continuity, boundary changes, and spatial
    lineages in longitudinal polygon datasets.
